%% Tauri desktop UX — full flow
%% Pure Mermaid. No Markdown fence.

flowchart TD
    trigger([Designing or reviewing a desktop surface]) --> surface{What is being added?}

    surface -->|A window| win
    surface -->|A menu| menu
    surface -->|Tray or close behaviour| close
    surface -->|A global shortcut| short
    surface -->|Theme handling| theme

    win[Set minWidth/minHeight a real<br/>layout survives — users WILL make<br/>it narrow]
    win --> persist[Persist size and position<br/>via the Window State plugin]
    persist --> multi{More than one window?}
    multi -->|yes| percap[One purpose per window<br/>+ its OWN capability entry]
    multi -->|no| kb
    percap --> kb

    menu[Native menus with CmdOrCtrl accelerators]
    menu --> osdiff{Which OS conventions?}
    osdiff -->|macOS| mac[App menu at the SCREEN top<br/>About/Quit expected<br/>app survives last window close]
    osdiff -->|Windows / Linux| winlin[Menu inside the window<br/>quitting with the last window is normal]
    mac --> kb
    winlin --> kb

    close{What should the close button do?}
    close -->|Document or editor app| closewin[Close the window<br/>quit on last close, except macOS]
    close -->|Background utility, sync, monitor| tray[Hide to tray AND TELL THE USER<br/>the first time — a silent vanish<br/>reads as a crash]
    tray --> quit[Tray menu ALWAYS offers a real Quit]
    closewin --> kb
    quit --> kb

    short[Register sparingly]
    short --> conf[Make it user-configurable —<br/>a fixed hotkey collides silently<br/>with other apps. Unregister on exit.]
    conf --> kb

    theme[Follow the OS light/dark preference<br/>allow a user override]
    theme --> kb

    kb{Fully keyboard operable?<br/>Logical order, visible focus,<br/>Escape closes, Enter confirms}
    kb -->|no| fixkb[Fix focus and key handling]
    fixkb --> kb
    kb -->|yes| done([Done: behaves like a native app])

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class surface,multi,osdiff,close,kb gate
    class trigger,done terminal
